I see. This is what gizzard shad tastes like.

2542
01:44:46,007 --> 01:44:47,637
- Isn't it tasty?
- It's so good.

2543
01:44:49,677 --> 01:44:55,117
(She falls in love with its rich and fatty flavor.)

2544
01:44:56,277 --> 01:44:59,017
(You Seok eats it with his bare hands.)

2545
01:45:00,287 --> 01:45:02,217
Try it without the sauce. It's seasoned.

2546
01:45:02,217 --> 01:45:03,657
(Surprised)

2547
01:45:03,657 --> 01:45:04,687
It's seasoned.

2548
01:45:05,187 --> 01:45:08,427
(The rich and fatty flavor increases when he bites into it.)

2549
01:45:08,997 --> 01:45:09,997
Octopus?

2550
01:45:09,997 --> 01:45:11,297
- Is it the one we just caught?
- Yes.

2551
01:45:12,267 --> 01:45:13,337
It's that one.

2552
01:45:15,137 --> 01:45:16,967
(She dips the parboiled octopus in chojang.)

2553
01:45:17,737 --> 01:45:20,377
(Right into her mouth)

2554
01:45:21,307 --> 01:45:22,937
(Opening wide her eyes of truth)

2555
01:45:23,907 --> 01:45:25,347
- It's very chewy.
- Yes.

2556
01:45:28,147 --> 01:45:30,217
Try it without the chojang. It's already seasoned.

2557
01:45:31,517 --> 01:45:34,787
(Octopus parboiled in the broth that Jung Ah made for a richer flavor)

2558
01:45:35,257 --> 01:45:37,087
(So that's why it's good.)

2559
01:45:37,627 --> 01:45:40,397
(Straight into her mouth)

2560
01:45:41,057 --> 01:45:44,197
- It's a feast of seafood.
- Completely.

2561
01:45:46,167 --> 01:45:47,797
- This is too good to be true.
- I love it.

2562
01:45:47,797 --> 01:45:48,797
(A spectacular seafood spread from the sea of Yeosu)

2563
01:45:48,797 --> 01:45:50,907
- It's so delicious.
- The silver pomfret is so good...

2564
01:45:50,907 --> 01:45:52,737
- that it's all I'm eating.
- Same here.

2565
01:45:54,107 --> 01:45:56,747
I can eat my entire bowl of rice with this.

2566
01:45:58,377 --> 01:46:01,847
(The star of tonight's dinner, spicy braised large silver pomfret)

2567
01:46:02,547 --> 01:46:05,347
(Picking out a big chunk of potato from the braised fish)

2568
01:46:05,947 --> 01:46:07,817
(She enjoys it in bite-sized pieces.)

2569
01:46:08,657 --> 01:46:10,957
(Taking another bite with some rice)

2570
01:46:14,527 --> 01:46:17,327
(She cleanses the palate with a sip of spicy broth.)

2571
01:46:18,897 --> 01:46:19,897
(A spoonful of broth)

2572
01:46:21,667 --> 01:46:22,667
(Another spoonful)

2573
01:46:23,237 --> 01:46:26,637
(Moistening the rice with the braised sauce)

2574
01:46:27,607 --> 01:46:30,607
(Enjoying them mixed together)

2575
01:46:31,107 --> 01:46:34,717
(She doesn't forget to eat a piece of large silver pomfret.)

2576
01:46:35,277 --> 01:46:39,187
(The two sisters are in love with the braised large silver pomfret.)

2577
01:46:40,087 --> 01:46:41,887
- Jung Ah, it's so delicious.
- Is it good?

2578
01:46:41,887 --> 01:46:42,887
- Yes.
- I'm glad to hear that.

2579
01:46:44,057 --> 01:46:45,127
Should we walk or ride our bikes?

2580
01:46:45,127 --> 01:46:46,287
- Should we walk or ride our bikes?
- Let's walk.

2581
01:46:46,287 --> 01:46:47,327
- Let's walk.
- Let's go.

2582
01:46:47,327 --> 01:46:48,327
(Lastly, it's time to finish the mural.)

2583
01:46:49,097 --> 01:46:50,567
You can see it clearly even from far away.

2584
01:46:51,627 --> 01:46:53,097
(The mural comes into view as soon as they step outside.)

2585
01:46:53,097 --> 01:46:54,697
It's cute and pretty.

2586
01:46:55,797 --> 01:46:58,307
Wait, walking there like this...

2587
01:46:58,937 --> 01:47:01,777
- makes me feel emotional.
- Right.

2588
01:47:01,777 --> 01:47:03,807
Walking there while thinking that this is the last time.

2589
01:47:04,707 --> 01:47:07,477
The sunset might have something to do with it too.

2590
01:47:07,477 --> 01:47:08,517
Right.

2591
01:47:08,817 --> 01:47:10,347
- It's so sad.
- I know.

2592
01:47:11,847 --> 01:47:13,417
Earlier while I was eating,

2593
01:47:13,417 --> 01:47:14,757
- Did you get emotional?
- I got very emotional.

2594
01:47:14,757 --> 01:47:16,117
- Right.
- So I calmed myself down.

2595
01:47:16,117 --> 01:47:18,857
(They're getting a mix of emotions.)

2596
01:47:19,057 --> 01:47:20,897
When those feelings start bubbling up,

2597
01:47:21,357 --> 01:47:22,627
think about the times when things were hard.

2598
01:47:22,627 --> 01:47:24,527
When you do that, all those emotions disappear.

2599
01:47:24,527 --> 01:47:26,527
Emotions suddenly hit me while painting.

2600
01:47:26,527 --> 01:47:28,737
When I focused on the painting, they faded away.

2601
01:47:28,737 --> 01:47:29,737
Of course.

2602
01:47:30,167 --> 01:47:31,267
Look at Jung Ah's face.

2603
01:47:31,267 --> 01:47:32,337
(They head towards the mural with smiles.)

2604
01:47:32,337 --> 01:47:33,507
Whatever.

2605
01:47:35,337 --> 01:47:36,777
- Hello.
- Hello.

2606
01:47:36,777 --> 01:47:37,847
Ma'am, what do you think of our painting?

2607
01:47:37,847 --> 01:47:38,977
Did you see the mural?

2608
01:47:39,477 --> 01:47:41,817
- It looks great.
- It does? Do you like it?

2609
01:47:41,817 --> 01:47:43,787
- Yes.
- Thank you.

2610
01:47:43,787 --> 01:47:45,247
- We painted it beautifully.
- We worked on it for three days.

2611
01:47:45,247 --> 01:47:47,317
- She's the one who designed it.
- No.

2612
01:47:47,717 --> 01:47:48,717
Thank you.

2613
01:47:48,717 --> 01:47:50,187
- You're welcome.
- Thank you.

2614
01:47:51,127 --> 01:47:52,187
(They're off to see the summer come to an end.)

2615
01:47:52,187 --> 01:47:53,357
I'm very happy with it.

2616
01:47:53,957 --> 01:47:55,057
Let's take a look.

2617
01:47:56,557 --> 01:47:58,027
(Shrieking with joy)

2618
01:47:58,027 --> 01:47:59,397
- It looks beautiful.
- Look at the starfish's eyes.

2619
01:47:59,697 --> 01:48:01,367
- They're so adorable.
- It's very cute.

2620
01:48:02,437 --> 01:48:03,437
My goodness.

2621
01:48:03,437 --> 01:48:05,337
(Our memories captured in one mural)

2622
01:48:05,337 --> 01:48:06,337
Goodness.

2623
01:48:06,877 --> 01:48:10,107
(The blank wall they encountered two days ago)

2624
01:48:10,447 --> 01:48:15,147
(The siblings were nervous to take on their first mural project.)

2625
01:48:16,117 --> 01:48:19,187
(But once they started sketching the outline,)

2626
01:48:20,087 --> 01:48:22,517
(the wall was soon filled with their own unique colors...)

2627
01:48:22,517 --> 01:48:24,927
(And memories they had together.)

2628
01:48:24,927 --> 01:48:27,757
Gosh, this is so much fun.

2629
01:48:28,527 --> 01:48:29,697
It's coming together.

2630
01:48:29,967 --> 01:48:31,097
We can do it.

2631
01:48:31,897 --> 01:48:33,797
(On one side of the wall, a coral-red starfish...)

2632
01:48:33,797 --> 01:48:36,037
(whose color matches Jung Ah's skirt)

2633
01:48:36,637 --> 01:48:39,667
(At the tip of excited Sun Young's brush)

2634
01:48:39,667 --> 01:48:41,507
(A stingray with sweetest little eyes)

2635
01:48:41,937 --> 01:48:43,877
(You Seok who lacked confidence at first)

2636
01:48:44,547 --> 01:48:46,777
(He left behind an adorable turtle.)

2637
01:48:47,477 --> 01:48:50,487
(Mural team leader Yoon Seo who felt the weight of responsibility)

2638
01:48:51,087 --> 01:48:53,047
It's a net that we worked with today.

2639
01:48:53,047 --> 01:48:54,087
(It captures the time they spent working up a sweat.)

2640
01:48:54,757 --> 01:48:57,157
(Bringing a once empty wall with a rainbow of colors...)

2641
01:48:57,157 --> 01:48:59,327
(with our story)

2642
01:48:59,327 --> 01:49:00,497
It's absolutely gorgeous.

2643
01:49:02,797 --> 01:49:03,967
(The siblings have a sea of their own in Seongdu Village.)

2644
01:49:03,967 --> 01:49:05,027
It makes me so happy.

2645
01:49:05,167 --> 01:49:08,167
- Well done.
- Well done, Jung Ah.

2646
01:49:08,767 --> 01:49:12,437
Shall we add our names, the final touch to our painting?

2647
01:49:12,437 --> 01:49:13,477
(It's time to leave their names.)

2648
01:49:13,477 --> 01:49:16,007
Write "Fresh off the Sea..."

2649
01:49:16,007 --> 01:49:18,747
- and "Jeong Sang Hun."
- Right.

2650
01:49:18,747 --> 01:49:19,747
Jeong Sang Hun.

2651
01:49:20,977 --> 01:49:22,417
Don't write it so big.

2652
01:49:22,417 --> 01:49:23,947
(Yoon Seo writes the names on their behalf.)

2653
01:49:24,247 --> 01:49:26,147
(Careful)

2654
01:49:26,587 --> 01:49:29,757
(Writing our name with love and care)

2655
01:49:29,757 --> 01:49:33,127
Murals last for a long time.

2656
01:49:33,597 --> 01:49:36,497
It's truly worth it.

2657
01:49:39,527 --> 01:49:43,637
I feel so proud. The younger ones were amazing.

2658
01:49:44,007 --> 01:49:46,907
I'm really glad that we decided to paint the mural.

2659
01:49:46,907 --> 01:49:48,607
Isn't this season's subtitle "The Ultimate Chemistry?"

2660
01:49:49,207 --> 01:49:50,977
It truly was the ultimate chemistry.

2661
01:49:52,247 --> 01:49:54,077
(Anything you want to say to the younger siblings?)

2662
01:49:54,517 --> 01:49:55,877
Well done.

2663
01:49:56,377 --> 01:49:58,017
Well done.

2664
01:49:58,017 --> 01:50:01,157
Keep acting hard. That's all I can say.

2665
01:50:01,317 --> 01:50:03,217
- Say that you liked us.
- What?

2666
01:50:03,217 --> 01:50:04,757
- "I liked you."
- "I loved you."

2667
01:50:04,757 --> 01:50:05,857
"I really liked you."

2668
01:50:05,857 --> 01:50:06,997
"I really loved you."

2669
01:50:07,327 --> 01:50:08,627
- I liked you.
- "I loved you."

2670
01:50:08,627 --> 01:50:10,597
- I loved you.
- "I really loved you."

2671
01:50:10,597 --> 01:50:11,697
I really loved you.

2672
01:50:12,897 --> 01:50:14,067
Aren't we practically controlling...

2673
01:50:14,067 --> 01:50:15,897
- I won't forget.
- her mind from the back?

2674
01:50:15,897 --> 01:50:18,907
I can't do the interview with them...

2675
01:50:18,907 --> 01:50:20,007
glaring at me like that.

2676
01:50:21,137 --> 01:50:22,707
(Due to concerns for her safety, we're switching players.)

2677
01:50:22,837 --> 01:50:23,977
Dear viewers.

2678
01:50:23,977 --> 01:50:27,217
(Jumping straight to "dear viewers")

2679
01:50:27,277 --> 01:50:28,377
Dear viewers.

2680
01:50:28,377 --> 01:50:31,187
I never imagined I'd get to connect with you viewers...

2681
01:50:31,187 --> 01:50:32,447
so closely like this.

2682
01:50:33,047 --> 01:50:35,217
And I did my best for you.

2683
01:50:35,357 --> 01:50:36,827
Right. I agree.

2684
01:50:36,827 --> 01:50:38,787
(Everyone recognizes Sun Young's love for her viewers.)

2685
01:50:39,027 --> 01:50:41,897
I'm talking about you right now.

2686
01:50:42,697 --> 01:50:46,397
(From our first day in Tongyeong)

2687
01:50:46,767 --> 01:50:48,597
(While cooking...)

2688
01:50:48,597 --> 01:50:51,567
(or working)

2689
01:50:52,207 --> 01:50:54,437
(Even in the moment when she fell)

2690
01:50:54,737 --> 01:50:56,977
(You should've filmed this.)

2691
01:50:57,647 --> 01:51:01,617
(Sun Young always gave it her all to make the viewers laugh.)

2692
01:51:01,617 --> 01:51:06,247
(Sun Young always gave it her all to make the viewers laugh.)

2693
01:51:06,687 --> 01:51:08,157
My dear viewers.

2694
01:51:09,917 --> 01:51:11,087
I loved you.

2695
01:51:11,487 --> 01:51:13,357
I loved meeting people.

2696
01:51:13,597 --> 01:51:14,727
They're all actors.

2697
01:51:15,927 --> 01:51:18,027
(Lost for words)

2698
01:51:18,167 --> 01:51:21,537
(Overcome with emotions)

2699
01:51:22,237 --> 01:51:24,937
Why are you crying? Don't cry.

2700
01:51:24,937 --> 01:51:26,537
(Sun Young suddenly bursts into tears.)

2701
01:51:26,837 --> 01:51:29,077
(Is Sun Young crying?)

2702
01:51:30,477 --> 01:51:31,807
Seriously,

2703
01:51:32,247 --> 01:51:33,877
we said we weren't going to cry.

2704
01:51:35,277 --> 01:51:37,047
I never thought this question would break me.

2705
01:51:37,047 --> 01:51:38,687
(All the sadness Sun Young was holding back comes pouring out.)

2706
01:51:39,017 --> 01:51:41,687
But I have nothing left to say to them.

2707
01:51:42,087 --> 01:51:43,627
I've already said so much.

2708
01:51:44,587 --> 01:51:46,997
I have nothing left to say. I'll contact them in our group chat.

2709
01:51:47,697 --> 01:51:50,097
Hanging out with them, going on drives,

2710
01:51:50,097 --> 01:51:52,167
and working together. That's what...

2711
01:51:52,267 --> 01:51:53,567
I will remember the most.

2712
01:51:54,397 --> 01:51:56,097
- I didn't get to do many things.
- Just talk about today.

2713
01:51:56,097 --> 01:51:58,307
I didn't even get to go paragliding.

2714
01:51:58,307 --> 01:51:59,667
You're only thinking about what you didn't get to do.

2715
01:52:00,067 --> 01:52:01,507
We rode the luge.

2716
01:52:01,707 --> 01:52:03,677
We went on ATVs and took a boat ride.

2717
01:52:03,677 --> 01:52:04,807
(Shall we go for a spin?)

2718
01:52:05,007 --> 01:52:06,347
We even went on a boat.

2719
01:52:06,347 --> 01:52:07,347
(He also went on a boat.)

2720
01:52:07,677 --> 01:52:11,417
(Magnet Kang led everyone to happiness.)

2721
01:52:11,417 --> 01:52:13,247
Did you enjoy being dragged around by me?

2722
01:52:13,757 --> 01:52:14,887
That's right.

2723
01:52:14,887 --> 01:52:15,887
(Getting pulled like she's possessed)

2724
01:52:15,887 --> 01:52:17,127
He's Magnet Kang.

2725
01:52:17,487 --> 01:52:20,327
Every time I come here, I want to do some kind of activity.

2726
01:52:21,097 --> 01:52:23,867
(A regret of wishing they could spend more time together)

2727
01:52:24,297 --> 01:52:26,267
(They tuck away all the regret here.)

2728
01:52:28,437 --> 01:52:31,137
The moment that stands out the most for me was today.

2729
01:52:31,137 --> 01:52:32,667
When we were painting the mural.

2730
01:52:33,367 --> 01:52:39,177
(From the first day we got together)

2731
01:52:39,607 --> 01:52:42,817
The feeling of accomplishing something as a team...

2732
01:52:42,817 --> 01:52:45,517
made me so proud. That's what I remember the most.

2733
01:52:47,187 --> 01:52:53,997
(Recalling all the memories, Yoon Seo bursts into tears too.)

2734
01:52:54,357 --> 01:52:55,427
Go ahead and cry.

2735
01:52:55,427 --> 01:52:56,857
(Go ahead and cry.)

2736
01:52:56,857 --> 01:52:57,897
Like me.

2737
01:52:58,767 --> 01:53:00,637
- Cry.
- Stop it.

2738
01:53:00,637 --> 01:53:01,737
Hurry up and cry.

2739
01:53:02,767 --> 01:53:04,437
She made my tears disappear.

2740
01:53:04,907 --> 01:53:06,467
They disappeared completely.

2741
01:53:07,207 --> 01:53:09,637
- By the way, - Sun Young!

2742
01:53:09,637 --> 01:53:12,207
I should've worn these earrings during the showdown yesterday.

2743
01:53:12,207 --> 01:53:13,477
I never got to wear them.

2744
01:53:14,947 --> 01:53:17,717
Why am I crying while putting this earring on?

2745
01:53:18,517 --> 01:53:21,017
The bottom line is,

2746
01:53:21,017 --> 01:53:23,257
I'm grateful to you all.

2747
01:53:23,257 --> 01:53:24,287
I love you.

2748
01:53:25,757 --> 01:53:27,657
- It's so pretty.
- It really is.

2749
01:53:27,657 --> 01:53:28,727
(Pouring all those feelings into every word)

2750
01:53:28,727 --> 01:53:31,527
(Our summer filled with passion)

2751
01:53:32,127 --> 01:53:33,667
- It's done.
- It's done.

2752
01:53:34,997 --> 01:53:36,467
- It looks quite good.
- Yes.

2753
01:53:38,007 --> 01:53:40,777
(The mural is finally complete.)

2754
01:53:40,777 --> 01:53:43,037
I feel so proud.

2755
01:53:43,877 --> 01:53:45,807
(The summer spent with Fresh off the Sea)

2756
01:53:46,247 --> 01:53:51,247
(A story we painted together)

2757
01:53:51,447 --> 01:53:53,087
Jung Ah.

2758
01:53:53,087 --> 01:53:54,957
- Let's give each other a high five.
- High five.

2759
01:53:54,957 --> 01:53:56,117
- Well done.
- Good job.

2760
01:53:59,457 --> 01:54:00,957
Come here. Let's all hug.

2761
01:54:00,957 --> 01:54:02,327
- Let's hug.
- Hug everyone.

2762
01:54:03,427 --> 01:54:04,627
Well done.

2763
01:54:04,627 --> 01:54:05,767
You smell so sweaty.

2764
01:54:06,027 --> 01:54:07,567
(The unmistakable scent of hard work right to the end)

2765
01:54:07,567 --> 01:54:09,297
- I took a shower.
- Me too.

2766
01:54:09,297 --> 01:54:10,937
It's the scent of hard work.

2767
01:54:12,467 --> 01:54:14,307
One, two, three.

2768
01:54:14,307 --> 01:54:17,377
(They take a family photo in front of the mural.)

2769
01:54:17,647 --> 01:54:20,917
(Fresh off the Sea 3, Our Family Forever)

2770
01:54:22,017 --> 01:54:24,447
- Goodbye.
- Take care of yourself too.

2771
01:54:26,547 --> 01:54:28,587
Where are you going?

2772
01:54:28,587 --> 01:54:30,327
(We look forward to the next season we'll share together.)

2773
01:54:30,327 --> 01:54:31,387
Don't go.

2774
01:54:34,257 --> 01:54:37,097
(This has been Jung Ah, Sun Young,)

2775
01:54:37,097 --> 01:54:40,997
(You Seok, and Yoon Seo.)
